WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.030
Welcome back, champ!

2
00:00:05.030 --> 00:00:16.010
Last time: algorithm = clear steps, in order

3
00:00:16.010 --> 00:00:23.490
Chapter 2 · Sequencing

4
00:00:23.490 --> 00:00:31.810
Sequencing = putting steps in the right order

5
00:00:31.810 --> 00:00:37.690
Order really matters. Let's see why!

6
00:00:37.690 --> 00:00:46.430
Running late! Robo, help me get dressed

7
00:00:46.430 --> 00:00:54.180
1. Put on shoes · 2. Put on socks

8
00:00:54.180 --> 00:01:05.360
Socks on top of the shoes! Oh no!

9
00:01:05.360 --> 00:01:13.610
What went wrong? Think!

10
00:01:13.610 --> 00:01:23.480
Nothing missing. Just the wrong order!

11
00:01:23.480 --> 00:01:36.310
Socks → Shoes. Happy feet!

12
00:01:36.310 --> 00:01:41.880
Steps in a set order = a SEQUENCE

13
00:01:41.880 --> 00:01:46.730
Sequencing = the right order, so the job works

14
00:01:46.730 --> 00:02:01.020
Like stairs: one step after another

15
00:02:01.020 --> 00:02:05.060
Order matters everywhere!

16
00:02:05.060 --> 00:02:12.900
Socks first, then shoes

17
00:02:12.900 --> 00:02:19.700
Unlock first, then open the door

18
00:02:19.700 --> 00:02:26.910
Open the tiffin first, then eat!

19
00:02:26.910 --> 00:02:33.870
Ask: what must happen FIRST?

20
00:02:33.870 --> 00:02:43.680
Computers do exactly the next step

21
00:02:43.680 --> 00:02:55.160
Open, then unlock? Bonk! Still locked.

22
00:02:55.160 --> 00:03:04.400
Robo won't fix the order for you

23
00:03:04.400 --> 00:03:17.470
Wrong order in → wrong result out

24
00:03:17.470 --> 00:03:24.610
Scrambled = steps all mixed up

25
00:03:24.610 --> 00:03:34.430
Some mix-ups are funny…

26
00:03:34.430 --> 00:03:43.230
…and some are broken. Splash!

27
00:03:43.230 --> 00:03:55.340
Swap = two steps change places

28
00:03:55.340 --> 00:04:12.780
Brush → Paste → Pick up? How do we fix it?

29
00:04:12.780 --> 00:04:25.580
Pick up → Paste → Brush. Sparkly clean!

30
00:04:25.580 --> 00:04:32.080
Unscramble game: lunchtime!

31
00:04:32.080 --> 00:04:46.430
Which step comes first?

32
00:04:46.430 --> 00:04:56.890
Open zip → Take out tiffin → Close zip

33
00:04:56.890 --> 00:05:13.730
Which step is in the wrong place?

34
00:05:13.730 --> 00:05:22.480
Drink goes LAST, after the juice is made

35
00:05:22.480 --> 00:05:28.280
Squeeze → Stir → Drink. Ahh!

36
00:05:28.280 --> 00:05:32.160
Your turn: practice check

37
00:05:32.160 --> 00:05:42.020
Pour milk before opening the carton?

38
00:05:42.020 --> 00:05:53.940
No milk! Open the carton first, then pour

39
00:05:53.940 --> 00:05:59.760
Sequencing = the right order

40
00:05:59.760 --> 00:06:03.620
Socks before shoes, unlock before open

41
00:06:03.620 --> 00:06:09.970
Computers do the next step. No guessing!

42
00:06:09.970 --> 00:06:13.360
Swap two steps and things can break

43
00:06:13.360 --> 00:06:20.030
Chapter 2 done!

44
00:06:20.030 --> 00:06:26.830
Next: Quiz · Tap Finish
